{
    "name": "Tanuja Maske",
    "email": "tanuja07@gmail.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Login User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "tanuja07@gmail.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Add Product
POST http://localhost:5000/api/products/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Sugar",
    "category": "Grocery",
    "price": 50,
    "quantity": 10,
    "image": "sugar.jpg"
}

### Get All Products

GET http://localhost:5000/api/products

### Get Product By ID

GET http://localhost:5000/api/products/6a5edf9bf84fa610668bcabc

### Update Product

PUT http://localhost:5000/api/products/6a5edf9bf84fa610668bcabc
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Sugar Premium",
    "category": "Grocery",
    "price": 60,
    "quantity": 15,
    "image": "sugar-premium.jpg"
}

### Delete Product

DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/products/6a5edf9bf84fa610668bcabc

